1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,555
Lift up your head,

2
00:00:03,555 --> 00:00:06,500
to the rising sun,

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Bahamaland!

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
March on to glory,

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
your bright banners waving high.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,000
See how the world marks the manner of your bearing!

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Pledge to excel through love and unity.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Pressing onward, march together

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
to a common loftier goal;

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Steady sunward, tho' the weather

11
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,000
hide the wide and treachrous shoal.

12
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Lift up your head 

13
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000
to the rising sun, Bahamaland,

14
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:08,000
'Til the road you've trod lead unto your God,

15
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
March on, Bahamaland!